cheap.answer:
The complement is drawing no aces:

\[
P(\text{no aces})=\frac{\binom{48}{3}}{\binom{52}{3}}
=\frac{17296}{22100}
\]

So,

\[
P(\text{at least one ace})=1-\frac{17296}{22100}
=\frac{4804}{22100}
=\frac{1201}{5525}
\]

FINAL: 1201/5525

